HOW TO ATTRIBUTE THIS DEPOSIT
  Kalkan, M., & Çavdaroğlu, G. Ç. (2026). Spatial skill is not temporal skill: a cross-validation
  audit of satellite-driven winter-wheat and sunflower yield prediction in Trakya, Türkiye
  [Data set]. Mendeley Data. DOI: [reserved — inserted on deposit].

THIRD-PARTY SOURCE TERMS (the derived values in this deposit are produced from the sources
below; each must be attributed as stated — verified against each provider's data policy):

  • Sentinel-2 L2A (spectral indices, distribution/phenological metrics) — Copernicus free,
    full and open data policy. Attribution: "Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data
    [2017–2024]". Derivative/"altered" products may be redistributed under this policy.
    https://www.copernicus.eu/en/access-data/copyright-and-licences

  • NASA POWER / MERRA-2 (climate features) — CC-BY-4.0; no use restrictions; cite NASA POWER.
    https://power.larc.nasa.gov/docs/referencing/

  • ISRIC SoilGrids (soil features, AWC via Saxton–Rawls) — CC-BY-4.0.
    https://www.isric.org/about/data-policy

  • ESA WorldCover v200 2021 (cropland mask only; not redistributed as a layer) — CC-BY-4.0.
    Attribution: "© ESA WorldCover project 2021 / Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data 2021".
    https://esa-worldcover.org/en/data-access

  • SRTM (topographic covariates — documented, NOT used in any modelled tier) — public domain
    (NASA/USGS).

  • TÜİK / TURKSTAT (Turkish Statistical Institute) district crop yields and planted area — public
    official statistics, redistributed here in a curated, study-scoped form for reproducibility,
    with attribution to TÜİK. TÜİK does not publish an explicit open-data licence; these values
    are freely and publicly accessible official statistics. If TÜİK requests removal, the curated
    TÜİK files (06_tuik_reference/) will be withdrawn and replaced by retrieval instructions.
    Source: https://www.tuik.gov.tr/  (accessed [access date — to be confirmed by author]).

NO WARRANTY. The data are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. See the manuscript and
its Supplementary for methods, uncertainty, and the honest (audit) interpretation of all values.
